  "notes": "{同盟|どうめい} refers to a formal alliance or league, typically between nations or organizations working toward a shared goal.\n\nFORMS:\n⟦{同|どう}→同〜：03962_dou⟧ (same, together) + {盟|めい} (pledge, oath)\n\nTYPES:\n- ⟦{軍事|ぐんじ}→軍事：14392_gunji⟧{同盟|どうめい}: military alliance\n- ⟦{政治|せいじ}→政治：01629_seiji⟧{同盟|どうめい}: political alliance\n- ⟦{労働|ろうどう}→労働：03785_roudou⟧{同盟|どうめい}: labor union/league\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {同盟|どうめい}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{結|むす}ぶ→結ぶ：02308_musubu⟧: to form an alliance\n- {同盟|どうめい}⟦{国|こく}→国：02204_kuni⟧: allied nation\n- {同盟|どうめい}⟦{関係|かんけい}→関係：01298_kankei⟧: alliance relationship\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{連合|れんごう}→連合：14450_rengou⟧: coalition, union (often temporary or broader)\n- ⟦{協定|きょうてい}→協定：05320_kyoutei⟧: agreement, pact (focused on specific terms)\n- ⟦{提携|ていけい}→提携：05773_teikei⟧: partnership, tie-up (often in business)",
